 "card": "Adds the network type to `CService::GetKey()` to eliminate cross-network address key collisions between networks such as Tor and I2P. Without this, per-peer address bloom filters could falsely assume a peer already knows an address on one network because an address with matching key bytes was relayed on another, suppressing legitimate address announcements. A legacy key function without the network prefix is preserved for AddrMan to maintain backward compatibility with existing peers.dat files.",
